      "maxH": 560,
      "color": "orange",
      "text": "Oscilloscope. A lab instrument: scope screens with division grids and phosphor traces, rotary knobs for the ten settings.\n\nLayout: Instrument panels in a grid: scope screens left, controls and measurement strips right; mono readouts.\nThe memorable thing: The ten settings as rotary knobs, and every chart on a glowing scope screen with channel labels.\nType: IBM Plex Sans 400–700 for text and titles; IBM Plex Mono for channel labels, readouts and chart axes.\nLight: bg #EEF2F6, surf #FFFFFF, ink #0F1419, muted #4F5D6A, acc #1F6FB8, line #C6D0DA\nDark: bg #0F1419, surf #151C23, ink #E4E9EE, muted #8D99A5, acc #7FB2E5, line #27323D\nMagnet rail on the right edge. Live prices on these boards are NSE closing prices from 25 Sep 2026; every chart is drawn from real data or the project's pricer."
    }
